app shows. Among them, the Android app (apps/procraft-android) uses:

- UniFFI (https://github.com/mozilla/uniffi-rs) — MPL-2.0: the uniffi crate in the library, and the
  generator of the Kotlin bindings (generated at build time, not committed).
- JNA (https://github.com/java-native-access/jna) — Apache-2.0 (dual-licensed with LGPL-2.1; used
  under Apache-2.0).
- AndroidX, Jetpack Compose, Material 3, input motion prediction and kotlinx.coroutines — Apache-2.0.
